note = "The score is packed BCD at $25-$27 (the points routine $F342 adds C600[X] hundreds: 100, 300, 500, 800). The bonus timer $2E starts at C207[$54] (0x50, 5000, on the first loop) with $45 = 13 ($CB94-$CBA2). $34 counts 10 down to 0 every frame and steps $3F-$45 when it wraps ($F4AC); $EBB6, called each frame in play, does nothing while $45 isn't 0, else with $2E at 0 sets $96 = 255 (a death), or sets $45 = 11 and takes 1 from $2E's BCD (F33E). In clear-25m clip 1, $2E goes 0x47 -> 0x46 at 1512, 121 frames apart after that; during the clear scene and a death $45 runs on to 0 and $2E holds. The clear adds $2E to the score ($CB0F calls $CC24) 90 frames after the clear: 200 + 3300 = 3500 at frame 3260 The barrels' timers: the let-go code at $DAB2-$DAFF drops a barrel in slot 0 straight ($C0) while the drum ($AD) is unlit, or once lit when $43 is 0, and either way restarts $43 at C44D[d] (72, 56, 40, 24); $43 steps on the divider's wrap. Kong's $36 and $37 count down every frame, through a death too (fall-too-far 001). Straight drops at 1232, 2750, 3993, 5962, 7092, 8217 and 9328 of the user's play; $AD 0 -> 2 -> 3 at 1403 and 1419"

